-- src:19138 | Section 423.1
-- src:19139 | 40 Section 423.1 of the Act, as amended by section 12 of this Act, applies only in respect of conduct engaged in on or after the day on which that section 12 comes into force.
@ref 2015, c. 13, s. 40 (src:19138-19139)
GIVEN `the day on which section 12 of 2015, c. 13 comes into force` IS A DATE
      `the day the conduct was engaged in` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`2015 c 13 s 40 the conduct is within the limit on section 423.1` MEANS
    IF `the day the conduct was engaged in` AT LEAST `the day on which section 12 of 2015, c. 13 comes into force`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "applies only in respect of conduct engaged in on or after the day on which that section 12 comes into force"


