      `the day the conduct was engaged in` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`2015 c 13 s 44 the conduct is within the limit on section 737.1 and sections 739.1 to 739.4` MEANS
    IF `the day the conduct was engaged in` AT LEAST `the day on which sections 29 and 30 of 2015, c. 13 come into force`
